 loc='to verify: El Alaoui–Montanari–Sellke, introduction (the beta < 1/2 range and the conjectured beta < 1).',
 url='https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.05093',
 why='It is the cleanest test of diffusion-model-style sampling (stochastic localization with a learned or computed denoiser) on a hard high-dimensional measure.',
 st='Open for 1/2 ≤ beta < 1 as far as the writer knows (to verify).',
